                  <msItem xml:id="ms_i1">
                  <locus from="2ra" to="45ra"/>
                     <textLang mainLang="gez"/>
                     <title type="complete" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT1936Mashaf">Maṣḥafa ḥǝmāmātihu wa-zenā sǝqlatu wa-qǝtlatu la-ʾƎgziʾǝna</title>
                  </msItem>
                  
                  <msItem xml:id="ms_i2">
                     <locus from="45rb" to="52rb"/>
                     <title type="complete" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT7934MiracleComChristDeath">Taʾammǝra tazkāra motu la-ʾƎgziʾǝna ʾIyasus Krǝstos</title>
                     <textLang mainLang="gez"/>
                  
                  <msItem xml:id="ms_i2.1">
                     <locus from="45rb" to="47rb"/>
                     <title type="complete" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT7934MiracleComChristDeath#Introduction">Taʾammǝra tazkāra motu la-ʾƎgziʾǝna ʾIyasus Krǝstos: Introduction and a miracle: How a man who threw the bread during the Commemoration of Christ’s Death was punished and then healed</title>
                        <incipit xml:lang="gez"><hi rend="rubric">በስመ፡</hi> <gap reason="ellipsis" resp="MK"/> ንጽሕፍ፡ ተአምረ፡ ተዝካረ፡ ሞቱ፡ ለእግዚእነ፡፡ ወአምላክነ፡ 
                           ኢየሱስ፡ <hi rend="rubric">ክርስቶስ፡</hi> ዘገብረ፡ ቦቱ፡ ተዝካረ፡ ሞቱ፡ ማኅየዊ፡ በክብረ፡ ሞቱ፡ ወስሙ፡ ይደሉ፡ ስብሐት፡ ወአኰቴት። ለዓለመ፡ <gap reason="ellipsis" resp="MK"/>
                           ስምዑ፡ አበውየ፡ ወአኃውየ፡ እለ፡ ኮንክሙ፡ መፍቀርያነ፡ <hi rend="rubric">ክርስቶስ፡</hi> መድኃኒነ፡ <gap reason="ellipsis" resp="MK"/></incipit>
                  </msItem>
                  
                     <msItem xml:id="ms_i2.2">
                        <locus from="47rb" to="48va"/>
                        <title type="complete" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT7934MiracleComChristDeath#PiousDeacon">Taʾammǝra tazkāra motu la-ʾƎgziʾǝna ʾIyasus Krǝstos: How a pious deacon saw Mabāʾa Ṣǝyon in Heaven and began to observe the Commemoration of Christ’s Death</title>
                        <incipit xml:lang="gez"><hi rend="rubric">ተአምሪሁ፡ ለእግዚእነ፡ ወንጉሥነ፡ ወአምላክነ፡</hi> ወንጉሥነ፡ ወመድኃኒነ፡ ኢየሱስ፡ <hi rend="rubric">ክርስቶስ፡</hi> ዘገብረ፡ ዘተዝካረ፡ ሞቱ፡ ማኅየዊ፡ ወሀሎ፡ ፩ዲያቆን፡ ሥርግው፡ መነኮስ። 
                           ብሕትው፡ በጾም፡ ወበጸሎት፡ ጽምው። ወስነ፡ ምግባሩ፡ ፍትው፡ ወምስለ፡ ኵሉ፡ ፍትው፡ <add place="margin">ምስለ፡ ኵሉ፡ ስንዕው፡</add> ተክለ፡ ሐዋርያት፡ ስሙ፡ ወኢያፈትዎ፡ ለዓለም፡ ጣዕሙ፡ ወዳዕሙ፡ በኃሢሠ፡ ጽድቅ። <gap reason="ellipsis" resp="MK"/></incipit>  
                  </msItem>
                     
                     <msItem xml:id="ms_i2.3">
                        <locus from="48va" to="49va"/>
                        <title type="complete" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT7934MiracleComChristDeath#BlindWoman">Taʾammǝra tazkāra motu la-ʾƎgziʾǝna ʾIyasus Krǝstos: How a blind woman was healed by observing the Commemoration of Christ’s Death</title>
                        <incipit xml:lang="gez"><hi rend="rubric">ተአምሪሁ፡ መንክር፡ ወዕፁብ፡ ለእግዚእነ፡ ወአም</hi>ላክነ፡ <gap reason="ellipsis" resp="MK"/> ወሀለዉ፡ ቅዱሳን፡ መንፈሳውያን፡ በሀገረ፡ ወረብ፡ ቋላዝን፡ 
                           ወሶበ፡ ሰምዑ፡ <surplus>ሰምዑ፡</surplus> ከመ፡ ይትገበር፡ ተዝካረ፡ መድኅን፡ አፍቀሩ፡ ወይቤሉ። ንሕነኒ፡ ንግበር፡ በከመ፡ ገብረ፡ መባዓ፡ ጽዮን፡ ጻድቅ።
                           ወእምዝ፡ ተጋብኡ፡ ወአክበርዎ፡ ለተዝካረ፡ መድኅን።</incipit>
                  </msItem>
                     
                     <msItem xml:id="ms_i2.4">
                        <locus from="49vb" to="50vb"/>
                        <title type="complete" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT7934MiracleComChristDeath#PunishedMan">Taʾammǝra tazkāra motu la-ʾƎgziʾǝna ʾIyasus Krǝstos: How a man was punished with an illness for sinning on the day of the Commemoration of Christ’s Death and daring to drink during the feast</title>
                        <incipit xml:lang="gez"><hi rend="rubric">ተአምሪሁ፡ ለእግዚእነ፡ ኢየሱስ፡ ክርስቶስ፡</hi> <gap reason="ellipsis" resp="MK"/> ወኮነ፡ ፩ብእሲ፡ ወረሰይዎ፡ ላእከ፡ ለማኅበረ፡ ተዝካረ፡ መድኅን። 
                           ከመ፡ ይቅዳሕ፡ አይገነ፡ ወይሕጽ<surplus>ሕ</surplus>ብ፡ ጽዋዓተ። ወአሐቲ፡ <add place="above">ዕለት፡</add> በበዓለ፡ ተዝካረ፡ መድኅን፡ ከመ፡ ይቅዳሕ፡ ሰከበ፡ <gap reason="ellipsis" resp="MK"/></incipit>
                  </msItem>
                     
                     <msItem xml:id="ms_i2.5">
                        <locus from="50vb" to="52rb"/>
                        <title type="complete" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT7934MiracleComChristDeath#WomanHen">Taʾammǝra tazkāra motu la-ʾƎgziʾǝna ʾIyasus Krǝstos: On a woman who wanted to offer a hen in observance of the Commemoration of Christ’s Death, but whose offering was not accepted</title>
                        <incipit xml:lang="gez"><hi rend="rubric">ተአምሪሁ፡ ለእግዚእነ፡ ኢየሱስ፡ ክርስቶስ፡</hi> <gap reason="ellipsis" resp="MK"/> ወሶበ፡ ሰምዓት፡ አሐቲ፡ ብእሲት፡ ዘትነብር፡ በደወለ፡ <unclear>ጸኃርት፡</unclear> ዜናሁ። 
                           ለተዝካረ፡ መድኅን። ወአፍቀረት፡ ወሠምረት፡ ወሶቤሃ፡ በጽዓት፡ ርእሳ፡ እንዘ፡ ትብል፡ አነሂ፡ ተገደፍኩ፡ ሎቱ፡ እትመሐጸን፡ ቦቱ፡ ወአበውዕ፡ መባዕ፡ በእንተ፡ ተዝካረ፡ ሞቱ፡ አነ፡ ነዳይት፡ ዓመት፡ ወእምዝ፡ አጥረየት። ፩ዶርሆ፡ ወበጽአት፡ <gap reason="ellipsis" resp="MK"/></incipit>
                     </msItem>
                  </msItem>
                  
                     <msItem xml:id="ms_i3">
                     <locus from="52va" to="57rb"/>
                        <title type="complete" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT2883RepCh164">Malkǝʾa madḫāne ʿālam</title>
                        <textLang mainLang="gez"/>
                        <incipit xml:lang="gez"><hi rend="rubric">ሰላም፡ ለዝክረ፡ ስመከ፡ ዘኢረከቡ፡ ተፍጻሜ<supplied reason="omitted">ተ፡</supplied></hi> መላእ<supplied reason="omitted">ክ</supplied>ተ፡ ሰማይ፡ ወምድር፡ እለ፡ ለመዱ፡ ስብሐተ። 
                           <hi rend="rubric">መድኃኔ፡ ዓለም፡ ተወከፍ፡ እንተ፡ አቅረብኩ፡ ንስ</hi>ቲተ። <gap reason="ellipsis" resp="MK"/></incipit>
                  </msItem>
                  <msItem xml:id="ms_i4">
                     <locus from="57va" to="61rb"/>
                     <title ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT6956MalkeaMadAlam">Malkǝʾa Madḫāne ʿālam</title>
                     <textLang mainLang="gez"/>
                     <incipit xml:lang="gez"><hi rend="rubric">ሰላም፡ ዕብል፡ ለልደትከ፡ መድምም። እምድ</hi>ንጋሌ፡ ሥጋ፡ ኅቱም። ኢየሱስ፡ <hi rend="rubric">ክርስቶስ፡</hi> መድኃኔ፡ ዓለም።
                        ልብየ፡ አንቅሕ፡ ወነፍስየ፡ ለስብሐቲከ፡ አዳም። ለሥጋየሰ፡ አኃዞ፡ ድካም። <gap reason="ellipsis" resp="MK"/></incipit>
                  </msItem>
                  
                  <msItem xml:id="ms_i5">
                     <locus from="61va" to="63rb"/>
                     <title ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT6619HomiliesFeastSaviour#ZaraBuruk">Homilies about the Saviour of the World
        and his feasts: How Zarˀā Buruk was asked to save souls from Sheol</title>
                     <textLang mainLang="gez"/>
                     <incipit xml:lang="gez"><hi rend="rubric">በስመ፡</hi> <gap reason="ellipsis" resp="MK"/> <hi rend="rubric">ናሁ፡</hi> ንነግረክሙ፡ ዘከመ፡ አፍቀሮ፡ ብዙኃ፡ ለመድኃኔ፡ <hi rend="rubric">ዓለም፡</hi> 
                        ዘርአ፡ ቡሩክ፡ ወአክብረ፡ በዓሉ፡ ለወርኁ፡ አመ፡ ፳ወ፯ለመጋቢት። ወኪዳነ፡ ምሕረት፡ አመ፡ ፲ወ፮ለለወርኁ፡ ወሶበ፡ ረከበ፡ ክብረ፡ ወሞገሰ፡ በኀቤሁ፡ ወወሀቦ፡ መድኅን።</incipit>
                  </msItem>
                  <msItem xml:id="ms_i6">
                     <locus from="63rb" to="64rb"/>
                     <title type="complete">Story about the origin of tobacco</title>
                     <textLang mainLang="am"/>
                     <incipit xml:lang="am"><hi rend="rubric">የዚህ<add place="above">ች</add>ም፡</hi> ጥምባሆ፡ መፈጠርይ፡ ማክሰኞ፡ ቀን፡ ነው። ጌታችንም፡ የተሰቀለ፡ ዕለት፡ ዕፅዋት፡ ሁሉ፡ ሲረግፉ፡ እርሻ፡ ይህች፡ ዕፅ፡ ርግመት፡ ለምልማ፡ ትገኝታለች። 
                        መላእክት፡ ረግመዋታል። ፫፻ም፡ እንግዴህ፡ ይህችን፡ ጥባሆ<sic/>፡ የጠጣ፡ ገዝተዋል።</incipit>
                  </msItem>
                  <msItem xml:id="ms_i7">
